{
  "_comment": [
    "ICAO 24-bit address ranges allocated to military operators. Used by",
    "adsb_classify as a fallback when a feed record has no dbFlags — which is",
    "common, because the community aircraft database only knows airframes",
    "somebody has already identified.",
    "",
    "Ranges follow readsb/tar1090's is_mil_hex table. Start/end are inclusive",
    "hex strings. Edit this file to tune; no code change needed.",
    "",
    "The 7CF800-7CFAFF ADF block is the one that matters here and is verified",
    "against live traffic: 7cf839 C-130J A97-466, 7cf9d4 P-8A A47-010,",
    "7cf9xx C-17 A41-211, 7cf8xx E-7A A30-002, 7cfafc EC135 N52-101."
  ],
